  "description": "Ddiaz Design 3D Model Repository\n\n![](https://www.electrive.com/media/2018/11/audi-e-tron-gt-concept-car-la-auto-show-2018-10-1400x700.png.webp)\n\nWith the electric powered Audi e-tron GT concept a four-door coupe is making its debut as a show car. The volume-production counterpart is set to follow in approximately two years, and the concept will make its film debut in Marvel Studios' Avengers 4, set to be released in theaters summer 2019.\n\nInstagram del proyecto: https://www.instagram.com/ddiaz.design/\n\nPaypal Donations: https://paypal.me/sergiodd\n\nBased on a Real Racing 3 3d model\n\nCredits: @VuckyZ123",
